    "text": "The density of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>NaOH</mi></math> solution is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;The molality of this solution is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>&nbsp;(Round off to the Nearest Integer):<br />[Use : Atomic masses : <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Na</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>23</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi></math><br />Density of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>",
